WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
One word can interrupt a simple instruction.
You try to name the color of its ink,

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
but the letters tell you something else.
In attention studies, researchers found that

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
a carefully framed suggestion could change this conflict
for selected participants. Then they discovered

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
the suggestion sometimes worked without hypnosis.
Interesting? Absolutely. Proof that a commercial recording

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
will sharpen your concentration? No. Begin with a free
twelve-minute task, observe what actually happens,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and ask what any product has demonstrated
before you purchase.
